fountain stone~

The fountain stands in the middle of the room, attracting anyone who
passes by with its beauty. It is made of stone ripped from the bowels
of the dwarven mountains. The center is three large statues, standing
with one hand extended up to form a circle. Clutched in their hands is
a piece of parchment, each containing one of the vows of Forsaken. The
vows are written in the purest of gold. Each time you drink from this
fountain, you are renewing your vows, and forging your soul with your
brothers of Forsaken.
~
