ghastly crypt~
Neutral human (and non-human alike) bones form the shape of this apparently ancient 
coffin. The strange thing is, despite the way the bones lie in contorted chaos, it appears to 
be air tight. There is a thick black iron-cast latch that seals it closed, for what appears
to have been an eternity due to the amount of cobwebs and the dusts of time that have
settled upon it.  A &07^&08v&00&07^&00 is engraved into the latch, perhaps this was a vampire's coffin long 
ago - and the cursed negative energy seems to permeate the continuum itself.
~
