fountain is large and awe-inspiring.  An eye-opening attraction that offers a
vibrant centerpiece to the Hanging Gardens.  At close to fifteen feet tall, it
leaves a lasting impression of power and strength.  Stunning is one word that
simply describes this marble masterpiece.  Clear blue water cascades from a
marble sculpture of a warrior, spear wielded, down a set of steps into a rather
large pool.    
