E
tome book 1~
   You open the dusty tome and find the ancient knowledge of past historians.
Many pages are marked.  Look pagenumber to see the contents of each page.    
~
E
2~
They looked down over the valley.  Here, this is where we will settle.  The
valley leading in here can easily be defended.  Gazing across the untouched
lands their imagination pieced the layout of the hall as it is destined to be.
They see the trainers, mighty wizards and aging warriors, priests with the
powers of the gods.  All of these, and the new ones.  They shall all come.  
The fire burns in them.  They know that the lands hold many things to give
those who seek it, and we shall know it all.  The sloven lords seek the quick
cash, but only those who prove themselves shall be admitted.  The quest we send
them on shall be challenging, but like a chunk of iron, the fire shall mold
them into tempered steel of weapons and armor.    
~
E
3~
   No Blade, nor whip, nor force of arms shall ever overcome the power of one
man's singular passion for the pursuit of knowledge and the celebration of
imagination.    
~
E
4~
   This page is dedicated to those Wanderers that have come before us.    
Ack
Autumn
Bloodsong
Caliquendi
Cheun
Corwin
Dragos
Grimble
Jimmy
Katri
Kulgan
Lan
MacDunn
Malkavain
Pookie
Ragnarok
Rohan
Tori
Venus
Verbal
Zog
~
