locker crypt ancient one o19368~
This small crypt is covered in thousands of pictures of struggles and triumphs. You don't 
see any pattern at first, but as you look longer you begin to suspect an impossible truth. If 
these ancient carvings are to be believed, the different characters in each picture are the 
same being who has existed on Raven since the beginning of time. Wearing dozens of 
faces and fighting in thousands of battles, you wonder what this being fights for.
